,{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-07-16T23:37:24Z","updated_at":"2025-08-01T10:20:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n-Reproducible in v4.5.beta3.mono.official [4d1f26e1f] and Official release Godot 4.4.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta3.mono - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7652) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-9600K CPU @ 3.70GHz (6 threads) - 31.92 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen setting values for FastNoiseLite.fractal_octaves, if you select too high of a value it will quietly return NaN. I ran some tests and it seems anything higher than 38 causes this. The expected behavior is that it would throw an error or print something to warn that it is returning NaN. This is also how I learned that you can happily set mesh vertices to NaN.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```gdscript\nvar noise = FastNoiseLite.new()\nnoise.noise_type = FastNoiseLite.TYPE_SIMPLEX_SMOOTH\nnoise.fractal_octaves = 476\nprint(\"noise.get_noise_3dv(Vector3.Zero)\n```\n\nI ran into this issue in C#, but it is also reproducible in GDScript, as seen in the MRP.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[example_2025-07-16_16-28-45.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21268466/example_2025-07-16_16-28-45.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108687/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108687/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}